$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2rvmach  LOC_AFTER=?

* The reverse machine reverses its input in one step per letter plus one, derived from the fragment calculus: the ` EvalsToInTime ` form of ~ revmach , whose conversion to ` TM2OutputsInTime ` is the machine-specific bookkeeping of ~ revinitc , ~ revhaltc and ~ tm2outtbr .  The calculus replaces ~ revcfg , ~ revos , ~ revstepf , ~ revit and ~ revrun by ~ tm2rvst1 , ~ tm2rvloop and ~ tm2rvhalt .

